Date: Sat, 7 Mar 2026 07:48:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 13/98] fix(feishu): persist bot media-only messages to DB
 (#12)

Media-only final payloads (images, files sent by bot) only called
sendMediaFeishu() without triggering message_sent / onFinalTextDelivered,
so downstream message DB never saw these messages.

Fix: emit persistence signal for media-only finals, generate fallback
content from media filename, and pass media messageIds in metadata.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
